  "id": "facilitative-anxiety",
  "term": "facilitative anxiety",
  "definition": "Facilitative anxiety is anxiety that is experienced or interpreted in a helpful way during a stressful task, so it supports coping and performance rather than undermining them. In this context, it refers to a more positive form of anxiety linked with better performance under stress.",
